{"4869480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plague Keepers", "steam_appid": 4869480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plague Keepers is a grim co-op PvE extraction shooter set in a world devastated by the plague. You are an inquisitor sent behind the quarantine gate to complete contracts. To succeed in your mission, you’ll have to fight the infected, rescue villagers, destroy plague biomass roots without getting infected, end dark rituals, find and reactivate abandoned infrastructure, and much more. Face this world alone or with up to 3 friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you remain inside, the more hostile the world becomes. Can you handle the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/ce0494ab9c65e22586f24d68592bd2bc.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick your weapon—crossbows, rifles, axes, hammers, landmines, primitive energy weapons, and Tesla coils are just some of the tools in your arsenal. Slaughter the infected, blast their limbs apart, destroy the sources of the plague, and take on elite enemies. Finish your battles with brutal close-range executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/023abecaf20944a2ca7cfdd649eec00d.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/023abecaf20944a2ca7cfdd649eec00d.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/023abecaf20944a2ca7cfdd649eec00d.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/d7ead6069b59dde7d668fff697942052.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the environment into deadly traps. Reactivate generators, elevators, gates, and transport systems to open new paths or to get temporary advantages. Get massive bells to ring to buy yourself and your team some time. Observe your surroundings and use them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/c071e4bcacba5bfa3808cc06db99d681.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/c071e4bcacba5bfa3808cc06db99d681.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/c071e4bcacba5bfa3808cc06db99d681.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/d81232a06225d6f032f03eda3fdbceea.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may enter this world alone, but sometimes enemies can overwhelm you and leave you with nowhere to run. If they bring you down, your squadmates are the only ones who can bring you back. Stand together, cover each other, watch each other’s backs, and survive together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/8abe1747070963a4c5f4cf3872bba2c3.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/8abe1747070963a4c5f4cf3872bba2c3.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/8abe1747070963a4c5f4cf3872bba2c3.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/edc40183571b416b2c4e6ef502743f5d.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve completed your contract, you may choose to extract immediately or to push your luck and try to gather additional resources. But be aware, the longer you stay, the more hostile the environment becomes. When you finally decide to extract, an increasingly dangerous world will keep you under pressure until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/e4e448206872b27f6f34e48f17995eda.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/e4e448206872b27f6f34e48f17995eda.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/e4e448206872b27f6f34e48f17995eda.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/8d22c7146a92f9686796ad1ad5c00c35.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight won’t last forever. When the time comes, an infected fog will spread across the land. Reduced visibility won’t be your only problem when that happens. If you don’t find shelter, you’ll face creatures that may be stronger than you can handle, and familiar routes will become your death traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/5e2e8547f3366ec40fa37f33eab40259.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/5e2e8547f3366ec40fa37f33eab40259.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/5e2e8547f3366ec40fa37f33eab40259.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plague Keepers is a grim co-op PvE extraction shooter set in a world devastated by the plague. You are an inquisitor sent behind the quarantine gate to complete contracts. To succeed in your mission, you’ll have to fight the infected, rescue villagers, destroy plague biomass roots without getting infected, end dark rituals, find and reactivate abandoned infrastructure, and much more. Face this world alone or with up to 3 friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The longer you remain inside, the more hostile the world becomes. Can you handle the pressure?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/ce0494ab9c65e22586f24d68592bd2bc.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Pick your weapon—crossbows, rifles, axes, hammers, landmines, primitive energy weapons, and Tesla coils are just some of the tools in your arsenal. Slaughter the infected, blast their limbs apart, destroy the sources of the plague, and take on elite enemies. Finish your battles with brutal close-range executions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/023abecaf20944a2ca7cfdd649eec00d.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/023abecaf20944a2ca7cfdd649eec00d.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/023abecaf20944a2ca7cfdd649eec00d.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/d7ead6069b59dde7d668fff697942052.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the environment into deadly traps. Reactivate generators, elevators, gates, and transport systems to open new paths or to get temporary advantages. Get massive bells to ring to buy yourself and your team some time. Observe your surroundings and use them to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/c071e4bcacba5bfa3808cc06db99d681.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/c071e4bcacba5bfa3808cc06db99d681.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/c071e4bcacba5bfa3808cc06db99d681.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/d81232a06225d6f032f03eda3fdbceea.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may enter this world alone, but sometimes enemies can overwhelm you and leave you with nowhere to run. If they bring you down, your squadmates are the only ones who can bring you back. Stand together, cover each other, watch each other’s backs, and survive together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/8abe1747070963a4c5f4cf3872bba2c3.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/8abe1747070963a4c5f4cf3872bba2c3.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/8abe1747070963a4c5f4cf3872bba2c3.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/edc40183571b416b2c4e6ef502743f5d.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you’ve completed your contract, you may choose to extract immediately or to push your luck and try to gather additional resources. But be aware, the longer you stay, the more hostile the environment becomes. When you finally decide to extract, an increasingly dangerous world will keep you under pressure until the very end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/e4e448206872b27f6f34e48f17995eda.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/e4e448206872b27f6f34e48f17995eda.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/e4e448206872b27f6f34e48f17995eda.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/8d22c7146a92f9686796ad1ad5c00c35.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1182 height=159 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daylight won’t last forever. When the time comes, an infected fog will spread across the land. Reduced visibility won’t be your only problem when that happens. If you don’t find shelter, you’ll face creatures that may be stronger than you can handle, and familiar routes will become your death traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/5e2e8547f3366ec40fa37f33eab40259.poster.avif?t=1788008979\" width=1138 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/5e2e8547f3366ec40fa37f33eab40259.webm?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/extras/5e2e8547f3366ec40fa37f33eab40259.mp4?t=1788008979\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Medieval co-op PvE extraction shooter. Enter sealed quarantine zones. Fight infected enemies, recover powerful relics, evacuate civilians, destroy the plague source, and use fortified positions to heal, resupply, and hold back the monsters. Once the contract is complete, extract alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/2b73ea9ea429d817a48cd698ee502070f77bd9bc/header.jpg?t=1788008979", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/22f00bde470e204f694aef18465539ba7c3093c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788008979", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4869480/22f00bde470e204f694aef18465539ba7c3093c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788008979", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 / AMD Radeon RX 580 8 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 25 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended. Minimum requirements target low settings at 1080p.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Pr